Coloring and drawing for kids is a game that gives children the opportunity to create and discover the creative process of visual art. It will also help your child learn more about the colors and coloring itself.

Your child will learn to draw cute characters in a fun way. Coloring book is a creative and educational app that will help your child spend time with an effective electronic device.

The app contains pictures on different topics that will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. Moreover, it contains many coloring tools for kids to entertain with fascinating sounds and funny animations.

The complex combination of animations and drawings makes this app unique! Coloring book for kids is a unique drawing game with animations. Even the toddlers can easily draw all the characters. Enjoyable sound effects and fun animations will bring lots of joy to little artists! The following is waiting for you:

- 12 topic packs with 295 pages;
- More than 100 fascinating characters for drawing;
- Easy coloring for kids;
- Different painting tools for customization;
- Drawing lessons;
- Creativity development;
- Development of fine motor skills;
- Simple and easy interface;
- Drawing game for kids 2-6 years old;
- More than 100 stickers;
- Possibility to save your drawings;
- Developing pre-writing skills;
- Parental Control;
- Possibility to use without internet;
- No third party ads.

The coloring book is designed for children of preschool age and is also suitable for girls and boys aged 2-6. All activities are designed to develop your child's creativity, fine motor skills and imagination. The most important thing is that the drawing turns into a fun and engaging process that will bring a lot of joy and discovery to your kids. Enjoy your drawings! Have fun!
